  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/SvkSHq7/banner.png\" alt=\"日曆計數器橫幅\">\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/p0nYcGM/infos.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><strong>📝關於：</strong></h3>\n<p>如果你希望 UI 文字中包含變數，那麼這個模組就是為你準備的。\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/p0nYcGM/infos.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><strong>⚙️功能特色：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>支援引擎：FORGE</li>\n<li>支援遊戲版本：1.19.2, 1.19.4, 1.20.1, 1.20.4, 1.20.6, 1.21.1</li>\n<li>完全可自訂</li>\n<li>變數（未來將持續新增）</li>\n<li>變數清單</li>\n<li>顏色代碼</li>\n<li>排版設定</li>\n<li>開關指令</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/p0nYcGM/infos.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><strong>✅相容模組：</strong></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fag-day-counter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/470/588/637757747386104652.png\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fag-show-my-coordinates-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/806/365/638174223471319247.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/p0nYcGM/infos.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><strong>📜合作夥伴：</strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/JqPjJKf/bisect-hosting2.png\" alt=\"合作夥伴\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/p0nYcGM/infos.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><strong>💡點子建議：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>如果你有能讓此模組更完善的構想，</li>\n<li>請至我們的 Discord 伺服器 <strong>#💡idea-suggestions</strong> 版塊中留言。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/p0nYcGM/infos.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><strong>👾錯誤回報：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>如果你發現了任何問題，</li>\n<li>請至我們的 Discord 伺服器 <strong>#🧰bug-reports</strong> 版塊中留言。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/p0nYcGM/infos.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><strong>👫社群連結：</strong></h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/we8yC7p\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/bX3jmNp/dc.png\" alt=\"我們的 Discord 伺服器\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCMny4h1EAJGaPJ7NWCnaaFA/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/cCx47FY/yt.png\" alt=\"我們的 YouTube 頻道\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252fantrolgaming%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4gQYW33/ig.png\" alt=\"我們的 Instagram\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://twitter.com/GamingAntrol\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Rc24xSX/tw.png\" alt=\"我們的 Twitter\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/p0nYcGM/infos.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><strong>❤️支持我們：</strong></h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/antrolgaming\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Hrsytj1/donate.png\" alt=\"我們的捐贈頁面\"></a></p>",
